    "backstory": "Once a barista at Burnt Beans, Cipher witnessed the Great Drip Drought firsthand. When the chaos hit, he scavenged what he could – a beat-up Static Tank, some toxic Gasser cannisters, and a pair of Echojacks to drown out the screams – and swore an oath to reclaim the DRIP for the people.",
